<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mixed in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 598.07, up 0.78.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 274 to 269.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.01.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 17,503,990 compared with 21,307,415 on Friday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
